<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Thursday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.75 /10.65   11.0 /10.85    11.5 /11.3</p>
<p>BPI			10.7 /10.65    11.1 /11.0     11.5 /11.4</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.7 /10.625   11.125/10.90   11.50 /11.375</p>
<p>PCIBank		  10.75/10.7     11.15/11.025   11.45/11.4</p>
<p>SolidBank		10.70 /10.665  11.05/11.00    11.45 /11.375</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.7 /10.6     11.05 /10.95   11.425</p>
<p>/11.325</p>
<p>Security		 10.85/10.65    11.15/10.9     11.5/11.35</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
